Added an opt-in pass over gateways to ``peat pull`` (``peat.api.pull_api.pull_downstream()``): a module can return the devices behind a device from ``DeviceModule.downstream_targets()``, and modules with a ``pull_downstream()`` class method pull them (the targets configured for a module only if it's selected with ``-d``). Devices behind a gateway are new devices with their own ID and output directory, without an IP address, so they aren't merged with the gateway.
